        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 画室附近的马戏团",
          "en": "A circus near the studio"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "修拉的画室附近，有一家很受欢迎的马戏团。雷诺阿、德加、图卢兹-罗特列克都画过它。1890年，修拉也开始画它。",
          "en": "Near Seurat's studio was a popular circus, painted by Renoir, Degas and Toulouse-Lautrec. In 1890, Seurat began to paint it too."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/circus.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "修拉《马戏团》1891，巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "Georges Seurat, The Circus, 1891, Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1891年 · 巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "1891 · Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT II",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 艺术和科学",
          "en": "Art and science"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "修拉想用这幅画，把艺术创作和科学分析结合在一起：线条的方向、颜色的对比，都经过精心计算。",
          "en": "With this painting, Seurat sought to bring artistic creation and scientific analysis together: the direction of every line, every contrast of colour, carefully considered."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/circus.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "修拉《马戏团》1891，巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "Georges Seurat, The Circus, 1891, Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1891年 · 巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "1891 · Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT III",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 最后一幅",
          "en": "His last painting"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1891年3月，这幅没有画完的画在独立艺术家沙龙展出。几天后，修拉因病去世，年仅31岁。1977年起，它收藏在奥赛博物馆。",
          "en": "In March 1891, the unfinished painting was shown at the Salon des Indépendants. A few days later, Seurat died of an illness, aged just 31. Since 1977 it has been at the Musée d'Orsay."
        }
